  annotation "note_1771588794675_1", anchor: "an orca who chose burial over further bloodshed", text: "The standard Incursion narrative has no category for this. An orca who entered a penguin forge-temple carrying a weapon that wanted to be used, and decided the killing should stop — not because he was beaten, but because he chose it. Grul Grulrend appears on no Nightshelf honor-roll. He appears in no orca hero-cycle I have found. The ice recorded him anyway. I have spent enough years reading what the ice chooses to preserve to notice when it holds something gently. The weapon remains entombed. That is worth more than most monuments on this Berg.", type: :commentary, display: :full
